Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_27_desc]
“Derpy, the goddess of clumsy grace,”\n“With every stumble, a smile we embrace,”\n“Your laughter echoes, a symphony of glee,”\n“Guiding us through life’s eccentricity.”

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_27_TOOLTIP]
Citizens of Cloudsdale is thinking about Saint Derpy Hooves, but what exactly they are thinking about, Derpy will never know.

